{"job_id":"F-78d24d0e79d6c5d447cb","family_id":"F-78d24d0e79d6c5d447cb","title":"유류오염손해배상사건등의절차에관한규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":19,"target_id":"2e6a10d9e92ff4755d706a6678e964f3ec07a37d6f9f66e47d1d002a778453c6","source_hash":"e3d9a1918b13cf267992a42a6fc726f8797ecd1edc98b5331de122ad7f618c40","text":"关于石油污染损害赔偿案件程序等的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":115,"target_id":"ed893c22ae68dd8f49760cf0a4c9f365bf101c4a490e86ff1828ca62836b8b49","source_hash":"6231812f5f6f24fbfe50a2862c9b16a584845a708f60cad5d927ae3200e6a99e","text":"第一条（石油污染损害赔偿案件等的管辖法院）根据《石油污染损害赔偿保障法》（1992年12月8日颁布的第4532号法律，以下简称“本法”）第十二条和第三十三条第二款的规定，管辖法院为首尔地方法院。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":115,"end":299,"target_id":"de9e57e11ffa9626d8477a58550bc94fb03a5711e020eaeded07ed457228718c","source_hash":"1693ff9702bf35b5101e11c04332e5a04e0aace30b0c525ac286bd2fc5ca97a7","text":"第二条（参与国际基金）\n根据该法第 36 条的规定，参与诉讼应以书面形式向法院提出，直至责任限制诉讼程序结束。\n② 根据第1款规定申请参加，应包括下列信息。\n1. 责任限制案件数量\n2. 代表的姓名和地址，以及，如果韩国境内没有接收服务的地点，则为服务接收人的姓名和地址\n3. 参与目的和原因\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":299,"end":323,"target_id":"2b798413ba45e4d8154a590a682bdf07ca38e84544f0b88fc168e6bb31a37e3b","source_hash":"d571cbf6f7e485564c90d2d5f68d5fbd855969666ae3f241e14bbb63ef0951a8","text":"补充规定 <1995年10月27日第1395号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":323,"end":353,"target_id":"6b2f28cd0587e4307f21689636af5e795e750e4332621629a1705fbd702099c1","source_hash":"cf4b1b2628dfdc04dcef16b0cc66bb12c9c1fac72732596e59a6f5f26146aef6","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005913-36426-ko","scope":"BODY","start":353,"end":429,"target_id":"9925d327438ca4ef088f72f95929deb3b4333b7d15488f66650b6b4a08541727","source_hash":"5b6c72baaf7fd745bed60ff7bb8fa2b990fd73ad16bc009b0c6725690f5e220d","text":"第二条（废止其他规则） 废止《关于石油污染损害赔偿案件管辖法院等的规则》（最高法院1992年12月30日颁布的第1245号规则）。"}]}